          "text": "Carlos85\n — \n11/1/19, 2:09 AM\nFriday, November 1, 2019 at 2:09 AM\nSo what do you think which one is better for best scores ;-). I calculated it.\nSame driver and car and The high end glider gives me 28 points for a 1st place for each actions.\nWith the super glider I get 30 points for each actions. So so the super glider has 75 points less base points then the high end so after about 37 actions the super wins. the only advantage at the Moment of the high end is that it gives 5% more combo time but at NBC this doesn’t matter in a good drift line",
